add('''<p class="note">The external evidence links point to the immutable repository snapshot and require network/repository access. All charts, selected images and explanatory content in this HTML work offline. Raw archives are retained locally and are not uploaded to GitHub; archive indexes and checksums are in the technical report.</p><p>To regenerate this report from the checkout: <code>python3 scripts/build-renderer-report</code>. It reads retained JSON and image sheets, without running a benchmark.</p></section></main><footer class="foot">Prepared for owner review · Native Sketch, task 002 · Recommendation is a scoped integration direction. Production selection remains OPEN; no merge or permanent backend commitment is implied.</footer></div><script>window.addEventListener('beforeprint',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('details').forEach(d=>{d.dataset.wasOpen=d.open?'1':'0';d.open=true})});window.addEventListener('afterprint',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('details').forEach(d=>{d.open=d.dataset.wasOpen==='1'})});</script></body></html>''')
